{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんこんばんは( ´ ▽ ` )ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも応援ありがとうございます！＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kazumi.takayama/img/blog/kazumi.takayama/img/2016/03/15/7117398/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まーいまいと＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BOMBさん\nありがとうございました(´^`)♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":".｡.:✽・ﾟ＋.｡.:✽・ﾟ＋.｡.:✽・ﾟ＋.｡.:✽・ﾟ＋.｡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょっと前に行っておりました\nグアム、楽しかったです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夏に友達と行ったので\n半年ぶりでしたが...笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新たな場所を発掘できました！\nバナナマンさんも一緒で\n楽しかったなぁ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3日目の朝、\nひどい偏頭痛の中フラフラで朝食ビュッフェ\n行くも、お粥3口が限界だったのは\n残念でした（；＿；）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私、数年に一度、\n強い偏頭痛が来るんです(>_<)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに前回は\nガールズルールのMVの日！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来る前に視界が乱れる\n前触れがあって、私の場合は\n芋虫みたいなウネウネした線が\n視界に現れます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その前兆があってからちょうど\n一時間後くらいに、\n頭と目の奥がおかしくなるくらいの\n痛みがくるんです...\nなんだろね(ﾉ;ω;)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも痛み止め飲んで\n1時間から2時間安静にしてたら治るので\nご心配なく〜ぅ(｡･υ･)/ﾞ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"同じような症状の人っているのかなぁ？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":".｡.:✽・ﾟ＋.｡.:✽・ﾟ＋.｡.:✽・ﾟ＋.｡.:✽・ﾟ＋.｡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"グアムに話し戻りますっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kazumi.takayama/img/blog/kazumi.takayama/img/2016/03/15/7117398/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kazumi.takayama/img/blog/kazumi.takayama/img/2016/03/15/7117398/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"↑\nホテルのベッドでゴロゴロしながら\nアプリで遊びました＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんかこの時めっちゃ笑いました！\n楽しかったよ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kazumi.takayama/img/blog/kazumi.takayama/img/2016/03/15/7117398/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヤシの樹の下で本を読むのが\n優雅すぎました...キラキラ☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日の乃木中を\n見てくださったみなさんは\nお分かりかと思いますが、\n私は一発目のビーチフラッグで\n一抜けできたのであとは自由に\n過ごしてました。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさん寝れた〜ε(｡･×･｡)з幸せ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ご飯場所(BBQ)にて。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kazumi.takayama/img/blog/kazumi.takayama/img/2016/03/15/7117398/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"↑撮影者:かわごさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「かずみさん、こういう服かと思いましたよ」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「え、どうなってる？」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ご飯こぼれないように\nナプキンを挟んでいて、\nご飯食べ終わったのに\n外すのを忘れて彷徨いてしまった時の図。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お肉おいしかったー！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いい思い出になりました！\nまた数年後、来れればなぁと。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとはお土産で大量に買った\nお菓子たちを配らねば〜！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":".｡.:✽・ﾟ＋.｡.:✽・ﾟ＋.｡.:✽・ﾟ＋.｡.:✽・ﾟ＋.｡."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後に！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"デジモンtri.の第2章「決意」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"を観てきました、昨日！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"仕事終わりにレイトショーで！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"素晴らしいよ...\nああ、素晴らしい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ミミも丈も好きで、もちろん\nパルモンもゴマモンも大好きな私からすると\n本当に神回でしたし、\n(デジモンは毎回神回だけどさ)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次回、三章は\nタケルと光子郎メイン回になりそう\nなのでやばいです..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"光子郎はんのピュアさと\nタケルの色男加減がたまらなくて、\n私は萌え死にしそう。\nどちらか一方なんて選べない。\n選ぶことないけど！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ネタバレ注意↓"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"映画観た人はわかるかな？\nヒカリが銭湯で滑ってタケルが助ける\nシーン！！！腰掴んで！！あれは...(*ﾟﾛﾟ)!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、\n光子郎はんの文化祭来るところ♡\nあぁ可愛い...好きです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"パルモンとアグモンとパタモン、\nゴマモンの可愛さも安定だし、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"レオモン登場に歓喜でした。\nいい奴、レオモン...（；＿；）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あぁ、熱く語ってしまいました(ﾉ;ω;)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"デジモン知らない人はごめん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"三章も絶対見ます！！！＼(^o^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では、今日はこの辺でっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日もね、とてもいい１日でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"素敵な日々に感謝です。\n頑張ります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさい✩°｡⋆⸜(ू｡•ω•｡)"}],"source":"archive"}